    "intro_html":  "Chicken inasal is the pride of Bacolod: thighs marinated in vinegar, lime, lemongrass, and ginger, then basted with golden annatto butter and served over rice. Each bowl delivers \u003cstrong\u003e49 grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e at a lean 562 calories for about \u003cstrong\u003e$2.84\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost). That orange butter baste is what makes it unmistakably inasal.",
